# sabotage=FieldsStayInSlotsThatDeferClosures: a field defers its closure though the empty arm of a test answers undefined by itself. A validating build reports the store that puts the field outside its slot
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: run-in-shell
# OPTIONS: validate references=narrow sabotage=FieldsStayInSlotsThatDeferClosures
# CHECK: AOT: StoreOfOtherType of field f
# CHECK: AOT validation: ImpossibleMutation
# PROGRAM-OF: fields-stay-in-slots-that-defer-closures-left-alone.ir
